BT 1 0 0 1 0 94 Tm 11.4 TL 0 0 0 rg /F2+0 8.6 Tf 11.4 TL (2.1 Architecture.) Tj /F3+0 8.6 Tf 11.4 TL ( The upper body is kinematically constrained at all times \(no free levitation\). Four corner towers each combine: \(1\)) Tj T* (a hydraulic macro stage \(PARAM-M02-MACRO-STROKE\) with leveling and lock seats; \(2\) a Lorentz micro stage) Tj T* (\(PARAM-M03-MICRO-STROKE\) within the PARAM-LORENTZ-GAP envelope; \(3\) progressive mechanical stops; \(4\) an optional SPORT) Tj T* -0.049083 Tw (positive lock. A shared ECU implements mode arbitration, the REQ-M21 interlock and power-loss detection. Layer stack, top to bottom:) Tj T* 0 Tw (upper occupant / safety body \006 micro stage \006 macro stage \006 lower chassis. Active isolation operates inside a bounded mechanical) Tj T* (safety envelope; comfort control, handling stiffness and crash containment are coordinated but independently bounded. This principle) Tj T* (remains valid if the Lorentz micro stage is replaced by another high-bandwidth actuator. Scope: this baseline contains no attitude,) Tj T* (counter-lean or pyramidal underbody feature; any such feature would be a separate configuration-controlled option with its own) Tj T* (evidence plan.) Tj T* ET
