BT 1 0 0 1 0 94 Tm 11.4 TL 0 0 0 rg /F2+0 8.6 Tf 11.4 TL (F.1 Master position statement.) Tj /F3+0 8.6 Tf 11.4 TL ( R5.22 is the Contract Diligence Baseline for MCRS-MOD-001. It defines a mechanically captured) Tj T* (macro\002micro isolation architecture with COMFORT and SPORT modes; requirements REQ-M01 to REQ-M27 with verification methods) Tj T* -0.062345 Tw (and quantitative-limit structures for power loss, rescue, lateral-g policy, stop curve, horizontal load path and sensor independence; the) Tj T* 0 Tw (SIM-001 verification skeleton; gates G0\002G5; phases Ph0\002Ph3; risks R-01 to R-25; a module-visible mass table with P50 and P90) Tj T* (reported against the declared confidence level; host WBS budgets for V-L and V-H under a 100 kg occupant policy; and an explicit) Tj T* (packaging residual \(V-L \017370 mm and V-H \017240 mm on the H-point definition, OPEN, P0\). TRL remains 2\0023. The Legal Owner is) Tj T* (Amirbahador Atai. No test result, certification, patentability or freedom-to-operate is asserted. Remaining work is evidence and) Tj T* (formalisation: D0 animation, SIM-001, single-tower bench, ICD-001 and STR-001 freeze, packaging re-baseline, independent reviewer) Tj T* (appointment and counsel-led IP filing.) Tj T* ET
